
================================================================================
                     THE NURSERY OF THE STILL DEAD
================================================================================

Once a thriving nursery filled with vibrant plants,
this is now the Nursery of the Still Dead (it says so,
in writing on the wall).

Withered roots snake across the floor, and the air
carries the faint scent of dried herbs and old earth.

================================================================================
                   SEARCHING IN DEPTH: find
================================================================================

The 'find' command searches through directories recursively,
revealing items hidden in rooms within rooms within rooms.

COMMAND                      PURPOSE
--------                     --------
find . -name "scroll"        Find all scrolls below this room
find . -type d               Find all rooms (directories) below
find . -type f               Find all objects (files) below

Try it now to discover what lies beneath the nursery:

    $ find . -type f

You may discover the laboratory hidden below...

